   "source": [
    "Plain, *emphasized*, **strong**, **bold**, <u>underlined</u> and\n",
    "~~struck~~ runs.\n",
    "\n",
    "Water is H<sub>2</sub>O and the area is r<sup>2</sup>.\n",
    "\n",
    "A “quotation ‘inside’ another” alternates its marks.\n",
    "\n",
    "Code faces: `literal`, `ls`, `/etc/hosts`, `strlen`, `Widget`, `PATH`,\n",
    "`--verbose`, `done`, `MAX`, `count`, `<br/>`, and `(...)`.\n",
    "\n",
    "Fill in \\<name\\> and maybe \\[a flag\\].\n",
    "\n",
    "A *lingua franca* and a *word*.\n",
    "\n",
    "A bare phrase carries nothing extra.\n",
    "\n",
    "Press <span class=\"keycombo\">Ctrl+C</span> or pick\n",
    "<span class=\"menuchoice\">File \\> Save</span>.\n",
    "\n",
    "An <span id=\"spot\"></span>anchored spot."
   ],
   "id": "991dfde5-9b44-46e5-845d-7121bf7a8d46"
